[[.TextNotice]]# [[.Name]]

An independent Go project using Fathomry [[.FrameworkVersion]]. This executable
checks configuration and reports safe metadata with a localized result. It does
not start a Worker, initialize services or execute business work.

## Build and check

Requires Go 1.27 or later and access to the selected Go module artifacts.
Generation itself performs no network access or dependency download.
For a remote environment, supply the bootstrap and documents described below
before running its configuration check; building alone does not contact Nacos.

```sh
go mod tidy
go test -race ./...
go build -o bin/[[.Name]] ./cmd/[[.Name]]
./bin/[[.Name]] --environment development
```

Run from this project root, or pass `--root /absolute/project/path`. No Git
repository is initialized by generation. If an unrelated ancestor Git marker
breaks Go's automatic VCS stamping, use `go build -buildvcs=false ...` or place
the project in its intended repository; do not modify somebody else's Git state.

